<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective July 3-9:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 70.21</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 74.77</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 76.88</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 80.74</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$190.02</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$142.52</p>
<p>Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$105.27</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 27.40</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.74</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 30.21</p>
</text>
